---

The two real benchmark series redistributed under `skrtrl/data/` are third-party
data and are not covered by the licence above. THIRD_PARTY_DATA.md records each
one's exact product, source, retrieval date, SHA-256 and terms; in summary:

* `skrtrl/data/sunspot.txt` — monthly mean total sunspot number (SN_m_tot_V2.0),
  SILSO, Royal Observatory of Belgium, Brussels (https://www.sidc.be/SILSO/).
  Redistributed under the SILSO terms; please cite SILSO if you use it.
* `skrtrl/data/laser.txt` — far-infrared laser intensity, data set A of the
  Santa Fe time-series prediction competition. No explicit redistribution
  licence is known to us; see THIRD_PARTY_DATA.md.
